 "remarks": "Step into this newer luxury townhouse in Mid-City, Stamford. Built in 2017, this spacious 3-bedroom, 2.5-bath home features a private Primary Suite and a stunning rooftop deck-perfect for morning coffee or evening cocktails with city views. Inside, the open and airy layout offers high ceilings, rich hardwood floors throughout, crown molding, contemporary lighting, and oversized windows that fill the home with natural light. The living room opens to a private deck, and the home is finished with custom cabinetry and beautifully designed vanities. This pet-friendly residence includes central heating and air conditioning for year-round comfort, along with two assigned parking spaces. Ideally located near major shopping centers and within walking distance to Scalzi Park, Mill River Park, downtown Stamford, restaurants, movie theaters, and more, the home offers both convenience and lifestyle. Low common charges cover trash removal and yard maintenance, providing easy, low-maintenance living. A fantastic opportunity to own a spacious, move-in-ready condo in one of Stamford's most convenient locations.",
